      ⍝ Bug 8: FloatCell::is_big() table last entry was 10^18 instead of 10^17,
      ⍝ so ⎕PP←17 used decimal for values ≥ 10^17 (threshold 10x too large).
      ⍝ Fixed in FloatCell.cc.
