      ⍝ Bug 11: ComplexCell::bif_power tested imag()>0 instead of real()>0
      ⍝ for the 0⋆N case; 0⋆N with N a complex with imag 0 gave DOMAIN ERROR.
      ⍝ Fixed in ComplexCell.cc.
