      ⍝ Bugs13 #1 (Blake McBride): ComplexCell::get_near_int() had its
      ⍝ imaginary-part validation commented out, so a significant imaginary
      ⍝ part was silently dropped wherever get_near_int() is used (⍴ ↑ ↓ ⌽
      ⍝ ⍳ /), while is_near_int() (used elsewhere) correctly required both
      ⍝ parts near-integer. Fixed in ComplexCell.cc.
